WEBVTT

00:00:04.067 --> 00:00:08.635
In this video you join a class and solve your first exercise.

00:00:08.635 --> 00:00:12.513
Click Session at the top, then Klasse beitreten (join class).

00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:15.599
Enter your teacher's class code.

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:20.349
Join, done. You need no account and no name.

00:00:20.349 --> 00:00:25.718
Here you see your own code and the class. Your code belongs to you alone.

00:00:25.718 --> 00:00:29.197
On the left under “Aufgabe” (task) you open the exercise catalogue.

00:00:29.197 --> 00:00:34.405
Choose the module at the top. The stars show how difficult an exercise is.

00:00:34.405 --> 00:00:38.114
We take “Zwei Rechner verbinden” with one star: start.

00:00:38.114 --> 00:00:43.642
On the left are the task and its learning goals. Read them all first.

00:00:43.642 --> 00:00:49.810
Task 1: cable PC 1 and PC 2.

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:58.282
Task 2: addresses in the same network. PC 1 gets 192.168.1.1.

00:00:58.282 --> 00:01:05.147
On PC 2 we make a mistake on purpose: 192.168.2.2.

00:01:05.147 --> 00:01:10.183
“Prüfen” (check) really tests your network and ticks off what works.

00:01:10.183 --> 00:01:15.464
Not fulfilled? leyoNET gives the reason, and the hint helps you on.

00:01:15.464 --> 00:01:25.057
PC 1 and PC 2 are in different networks. We correct it: 192.168.1.2.

00:01:25.057 --> 00:01:29.383
Check again: all learning goals are fulfilled!

00:01:29.383 --> 00:01:34.468
Your teacher sees your progress automatically. You need not report anything.

00:01:34.468 --> 00:01:40.328
Stuck? “Hilfe anfordern” (ask for help) tells your teacher.

00:01:40.328 --> 00:01:43.440
Once it is solved, click it again.

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:49.551
A session saves automatically. To hand in: enter a project name …

00:01:49.551 --> 00:01:54.117
… and save it as a file with Ctrl+S.

00:01:54.117 --> 00:01:58.883
Hand in the file and your worksheet the way your teacher asks.

00:01:58.883 --> 00:02:02.746
Now you are ready. Have fun with leyoNET!
